'''Haggards''' are a {{Rarity|c|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
A '''Haggard''' can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level XV (15)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for a '''Haggard''' is {{Green|5,000}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|50%|1|2|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase its weight:
